Description: Use the full C API for the D-Bus helper on free-threaded Python
 The helper requests the legacy stable ABI (3.13 on Python 3.15). That ABI
 cannot be used with the free-threaded headers. Keep the D-Bus integration
 enabled and compile it for the active interpreter using the full C API.
 This does not declare the hand-written helper to be safe without the GIL.
Author: StableKite
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-11-17

--- a/project.py
+++ b/project.py
@@ -23,3 +23,4 @@
 import sys
-
+import sysconfig
+
 from pyqtbuild import PyQtBindings, PyQtProject, QmakeTargetInstallable
@@ -303,3 +304,3 @@
         buildable = BuildableModule(self, 'dbus', 'dbus.mainloop.pyqt5',
-                uses_limited_api=True)
+                uses_limited_api=not sysconfig.get_config_var('Py_GIL_DISABLED'))
         buildable.builder_settings.append('QT -= gui')
